{
 "1": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Waiting for a sign to start?",
   "source": "commentary/en/1.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "The Creative\nsays: begin.",
    "source": "commentary/en/1.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "No conditions.\nJust mean it.",
    "source": "commentary/en/1.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What would you\nstart today?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "plates": [
   "1-11",
   "1-27"
  ],
  "caption": {
   "text": "The Creative is six unbroken lines: a start with nothing held back. It asks for no conditions, only that you mean it.",
   "source": "commentary/en/1.json#judgment.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "2": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Tired of always having to lead?",
   "source": "commentary/en/2.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "The Receptive\nsays: follow well.",
    "source": "commentary/en/2.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Supporting is its\nown strength.",
    "source": "commentary/en/2.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "Who could\nyou back?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "plates": [
   "2-57",
   "2-32"
  ],
  "caption": {
   "text": "The Receptive’s old image is a mare, strong and at her best when she follows well. Backing someone is its own strength.",
   "source": "commentary/en/2.json#judgment.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "29": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "One problem after another?",
   "source": "commentary/en/29.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "The Abyss says:\nkeep moving.",
    "source": "commentary/en/29.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Like water: fill\nit, flow on.",
    "source": "commentary/en/29.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What's the next\nsmall step?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "plates": [
   "29-31",
   "29-60"
  ],
  "caption": {
   "text": "The I-Ching’s image here is water. It fills the hole it meets, then flows on.",
   "source": "commentary/en/29.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "30": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Brilliant once,\nthen burnt out?",
   "source": "commentary/en/30.json#image.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Fire’s answer:\nkeep it fed.",
    "source": "commentary/en/30.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Steady care,\nnot big gestures.",
    "source": "commentary/en/30.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What needs\ntending today?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "plates": [
   "30-20",
   "30-47"
  ],
  "caption": {
   "text": "Fire needs something to burn. The old text says to tend a cow: patient, dull, daily care. That’s what keeps the light going.",
   "source": "commentary/en/30.json#judgment.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "51": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Did something just\nshake you?",
   "source": "commentary/en/51.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "The Arousing says:\nuse the fear.",
    "source": "commentary/en/51.json#image.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Let it show\nwhat to fix.",
    "source": "commentary/en/51.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What did the\nscare show you?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "plates": [
   "51-2",
   "51-38"
  ],
  "caption": {
   "text": "The image is thunder, twice. You scream, then you laugh, and your hands still don’t drop the cup. A good scare is a chance to put things in order.",
   "source": "commentary/en/51.json#judgment.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "52": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Can't stop overthinking?",
   "source": "commentary/en/52.json#judgment.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "Keeping Still\nsays: pause.",
    "source": "commentary/en/52.json#judgment.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Stay with where\nyou are now.",
    "source": "commentary/en/52.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What can wait?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "plates": [
   "52-12",
   "52-1"
  ],
  "caption": {
   "text": "The old text says to keep your back still, so you stop chasing what’s in front of you.",
   "source": "commentary/en/52.json#judgment.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "57": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Said it once,\nnothing changed?",
   "source": "commentary/en/57.json#image.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "The Gentle says:\nsay it again.",
    "source": "commentary/en/57.json#image.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Quiet and steady\ngets through.",
    "source": "commentary/en/57.json#judgment.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "What’s worth\nrepeating today?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "plates": [
   "57-48",
   "57-64"
  ],
  "caption": {
   "text": "The image is wind following wind. One gust changes nothing; a wind that keeps blowing reshapes the land. Say the important thing more than once.",
   "source": "commentary/en/57.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 },
 "58": {
  "hook": {
   "text": "Good news, no one to tell?",
   "source": "commentary/en/58.json#image.synthesis"
  },
  "meaning": [
   {
    "text": "The Joyous says:\nshare it.",
    "source": "commentary/en/58.json#image.synthesis"
   },
   {
    "text": "Joy kept alone\ndries up.",
    "source": "commentary/en/58.json#image.synthesis"
   }
  ],
  "question": {
   "text": "Who could you\ncall today?",
   "source": "written"
  },
  "plates": [
   "58-19",
   "58-24"
  ],
  "caption": {
   "text": "The Joyous is two lakes that keep each other full. Joy kept to yourself dries up.",
   "source": "commentary/en/58.json#image.synthesis"
  }
 }
}
